  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s Resilience, Empowerment, Access and Capacities (Women&apos;s R.E.A.C.H. Project)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This programme aims at &lt;strong&gt;increasing social and economic resilience of&lt;/strong&gt; v&lt;strong&gt;ulnerable women and girls, GBV survivors and other affected women and their families. &lt;/strong&gt;Through the provision of livelihood opportunities and income-generating activities, the programme aims to enhance economic empowerment of strategic vulnerable target groups. It also seeks to transform harmful social norms through community engagement and education, fostering acceptance of women&apos;s socio-economic roles. By strengthening CSOs&apos; leadership capacities and improving access to gender data, the project will also enhance informed crisis response planning, and provide vital support to women rights organisations through a dedicated funding mechanism.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
